#################################################################



#################################################################
#  v1.169.0 — RegisterSession completeness and integrity, both
#  register-level and per-session, closing the gap G47 left open:
#  a register must actually have real sessions, not just permit
#  them, and each one must record whether it verified state first.
#  Two more real, bounded instances added -- not a full historical
#  retrofit of every turn, the same disclosed scoping decision
#  already made for HumanInteraction/ReviewEvidence in the proposal.
#################################################################



#################################################################
#  v1.170.0 — the ontology-driven governance conversion named as
#  what it structurally is: one strategic outcome spanning six real
#  epics, per Initiative's own real definition and decomposesInto's
#  own real "an initiative into epics" example. One-time structural
#  addition; no enforcement question, per the proposal's own G47
#  analysis.
#################################################################







