#  THE REGISTER PACKAGE. Built from the ratified conventions:
#    - register data: this file, under configuration:ABoxFileConvention
#    - profile declaration: the AdoptionProfile lives in this same file
#      (one file, two roles; each RegisterArtifact carries one role)
#    - progress report: the FIRST retained roadmap report run, written
#      by backlog_roadmap_report_v1_6_0 on register v9.68.0 and kept as
#      04-documentation/roadmap_report_run_v1_239_0.md under
#      configuration:RoadmapReportConvention (its kind: prof:RoadmapReportKind)
#    - manifest: MANIFEST_SHA256.txt. Its own SHA-256 cannot be recorded
#      inside a file the manifest covers (the register), because the
#      manifest would then have to cover its own digest -- no fixed
#      point exists. The value below is the digest of the manifest AS
#      PUBLISHED at v1.238.0 (commit 9a85c64), a real, checkable
#      historical digest; the digest of each release's manifest is
#      carried outside the manifest's coverage by the publisher
#      (PUBLISH_RECORD.ttl, manifestVerified/manifestTotal) and by the
#      release tag. Stated, not hidden (G7).
#################################################################

#################################################################
