#  OE_to_backlog-roadmap-framework_risk-facet-registration_v1_0_0, 2026-09-08).
#  Not risk:hasIdentifiedRisk (risk = prospective uncertainty; these
#  findings are confirmed, retrospective facts) but quality:hasFinding
#  from a quality:QualityAssessment this register mints, each finding
#  multi-typed quality:Finding alongside its own RetrospectiveFinding
#  type -- using OE's classes to type our individuals, not minting
#  OE vocabulary (B1). 43 findings.
#################################################################
