#  case, a scenario set, a behaviour diagram or a domain model. Four
#  were requested from another registrant in the previous commit (1b65620, their
#  inbox). Until they exist, the use cases cannot be typed, and a
#  use case written with no kind to point at is exactly the artifact
#  nobody can check -- the thing this lineage exists to end.
#  So: the goals are recorded now, the obligation is recorded as an
#  impediment, and the Goal stage's OWED ARTIFACTS are the first
#  work of the Objective and Backlog stages once the kinds exist.
