#################################################################
#  v9.77.0 (2026-09-10, brsf-session) -- LINEAGE 9, Backlog stage.
#  Consumes Out_Objective_SDLC (276ab48). Status moves to
#  LS_Backlogged. Five stories, one per objective, all Proposed:
#  nothing is planned into an iteration in this commit, because
#  planning is the next act and a story planned in the same breath
#  as it is written has been groomed by nobody.
#
#  What this stage does NOT carry, and why. Under OS_SDLC_v1 a
#  Backlog stage owes a class-diagram ModelArtifact and acceptance
#  criteria. Criteria are here. The class diagram is not: lineage 9
#  adopted no obligation set, having opened before one existed
#  (G91), and adding an artifact because a rule this lineage is
#  BUILDING would demand it -- from a lineage that never declared it
#  -- is precisely the retroactive binding the owner has stopped
#  three times. The first lineage that owes a class diagram is the
#  one story SDLC-S01 opens.
#################################################################

# Each story is the live work able to move its objective's metric: metricMovableBy is the objective's
# side of pursuesObjective, and an open objective that blocks its mission's closure must name one
# (L3). Recorded here, in the same commit as the stories, because the link is a fact about the
# backlog just written -- not a later addition.
# metricMovableBy link to fw:S_SDLC_FirstAdopter removed 2026-09-13: that item is genuinely Done
# (real loan-desk evidence, Obj_SDLC_Enforced/Obj_SDLC_Proven) but was never actually able to move
# THIS metric (a real, non-test-drive adopter) -- the link was false, not stale. Per
# backlog_lineage_compass_v1_0_0 run live 2026-09-13: no live corrective item exists for
# Obj_SDLC_Adopted, none is manufactured here, and the choice between seeking a real adopter or
# redefining what "adopted" means is the owner's, not this session's.
# Links to fw:S_SDLC_ProofHeld and fw:S_SDLC_FixturePair removed 2026-09-14: neither could ever move
# Metric_SDLC_UnprovenShapes (checked directly, not assumed) -- S05 is Done, and S07's own AC never
# reached the 3 structural shapes that were actually missing a fixture. fw:T_SDLC_ShapeProof (Done)
# is the real item that closed it, kept here as the honest record even though it too can move nothing
# further now the metric is at target.


#################################################################
