fw:RE_GovMit_MetricMirror a backlog:RefinementEvent ; backlog:refines fw:ST_GovMit_MetricMirror ;
    backlog:refinedAt "2026-09-21T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasRefinementOutcome "Real design: a pure register-content check, unlike GOV-S01/GOV-S02 which needed real git history -- this is answerable entirely from the register's own graph, so a SHACL shape, not a standalone script, matching how G97 checked lineage-level status lag. For any Objective whose latest real MetricObservation has reached or passed its target (respecting hasTargetDirection -- Increase means at or above, Decrease at or below, Hold means equal), the shape checks whether at least one of its metricMovableBy items has actually left Proposed. None having moved is the exact, real gap the handover named: an objective can read as met while its own plan was never touched." .
fw:DoD_GovMit_Infrastructure a backlog:DefinitionOfDone ; rdfs:label "Definition of Done for Lineage 16's own infrastructure work"@en ;
