    backlog:hasRefinementOutcome "Real design, grounded in HANDOVER_vaf-pipeline-session...retrofit-governance-process-divergence's own real, concrete options (accepted 2026-09-21): combines Option C (a real, git-anchored check -- a Done item's claimed startedAt/finishedAt span must overlap a real commit, matching how closedAtCommit already git-witnesses stage order) with Option A (a real, register-content-only SHACL shape flagging identical plannedAt=startedAt=finishedAt across multiple items in one register, a low-noise, mechanically-checkable signal distinguishable from genuine same-instant work by its own repetition). Option B (an honest CompressedExecutionShape advisory) deliberately not adopted for THIS story: it changes what compressed execution is allowed to mean, a separate, real design question from constraining fabrication, and would blur this story's own narrow, checkable claim." .

