    backlog:areaMeasure "Counted 2026-10-07 over the live and archive data files: 10 missions have an outcome; 2 ended missions have no closure report (Lineage 17, abandoned; the first-built lineage, achieved) and 10 cancelled items (6 in Lineage 17, 2 in the ontology-driven lineage, 1 each in two others) are named by no report." ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:areaLocation "01-ontologies/ (live and archive data files), 02-shacl-safeguards/" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_RecordsTellTruth .
